class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1299983#post1299983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could you summarise the parts you found interesting?<br /> Not that I don't want to watch 1h30 video of the gentleman gamer's but getting some quick points would be nice too!</div> </div> </div> </div>Not much actually Contagion-focused has happened yet, but what I really appreciate about the AP is that Dawkins manages to find a way to run a game that manages to accommodate the themes and needs of four different types of monster (the players are a Beast, a Promethean, a changeling, and a werewolf--this last one is especially interesting because the werewolf in question is in fact an Ivory Claw).<br /> <br /> It may also be that I enjoy watching someone who is an expert Storyteller at work; I've been making mental notes on how to use these as lessons for improving my own games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T11:26:28-07:00","id":1300014,"title":"","content":"Backed! Can only skim through the preview right now, but it seems awesome","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T11:58:48-07:00","id":1300022,"title":"","content":"The first manuscript release is (of course) the introduction, and the \u201csocial splats\u201d: the Sworn and the False. If the book outline is being followed in order, next week should give us Vectors and Plagues, Interstitial and Otherwise. Following that should be Storytelling, five chapters of Contagious fiction, and Outbreak Sites (a dozen settings worldwide). <br /> <br /> I\u2019m wondering at what point in the outline we\u2019ll start getting the crossover rules (as in, how do existing elements of game A interact with game B). My guess is that it will start with the Storytelling chapter: Vectors and Plagues are about introducing new elements to the setting; and while they\u2019ll facilitate crossover, I don\u2019t anticipate them addressing existing crossover questions all that much. But I can see the Storytelling chapter doing a deep dive into various matters like what happens when a mage or Promethean enters the Hedge, or a vampire tries to feed from a Mummy or Demon. If I\u2019m right about this, then Week 3 is when the bulk of the crossover issues will be addressed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T12:05:46-07:00","id":1300025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300022#post1300022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m wondering at what point in the outline we\u2019ll start getting the crossover rules (as in, how do existing elements of game A interact with game B).</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually don't expect much of this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T12:09:13-07:00","id":1300026,"title":"","content":"Hey i know other supernaturals outside of the major gameline ones can join these Orders, but i did wonder if an Alchemist or a Hobgoblin could join the Sworn. As i have only seen examples of them among the false, i think it is rather natural that a more ambigious/more benevolent hob could join the sworn if the begotten or vampires can do it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8100-caedus","name":"Caedus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"300"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T12:17:18-07:00","id":1300029,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300025#post1300025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I actually don't expect much of this.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do. In many ways, this is the book's mandate; and while I don't expect them to address how every edge-case of A interacts with B, I do expect that the big issues will be addressed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T12:20:33-07:00","id":1300031,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caedus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300026#post1300026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey i know other supernaturals outside of the major gameline ones can join these Orders, but i did wonder if an Alchemist or a Hobgoblin could join the Sworn. As i have only seen examples of them among the false, i think it is rather natural that a more ambigious/more benevolent hob could join the sworn if the begotten or vampires can do it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hobs feel like they'd be a bit more of stretch, but I don't see why not. I expect Alchemists would be all over this shit.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300022#post1300022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The first manuscript release is (of course) the introduction, and the \u201csocial splats\u201d: the Sworn and the False. If the book outline is being followed in order, next week should give us Vectors and Plagues, Interstitial and Otherwise. Following that should be Storytelling, five chapters of Contagious fiction, and Outbreak Sites (a dozen settings worldwide).</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think its going entirely in order. James said in the comments we will get our first setting section by Friday.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 03-26-2019, 03:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T12:23:56-07:00","id":1300032,"title":"","content":"Double Post","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T12:40:42-07:00","id":1300039,"title":"","content":"I'm really excited to learn more about what sorts of weird shit the Contagion is up to. The chapter on the Sworn and the False do a good job of hinting at what's to come. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T12:44:57-07:00","id":1300040,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300029#post1300029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do. In many ways, this is the book's mandate; and while I don't expect them to address how every edge-case of A interacts with B, I do expect that the big issues will be addressed.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's also been a lot of backtracking, both official and unofficial, from the initial announcement as the &quot;Crossover Chronicle&quot;. Dark Eras 2 will probably contain more in-depth rulings for paired games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T13:04:07-07:00","id":1300049,"title":"","content":"So, the False are defined by not using Vectors, but the hot strains of the Contagion itself.<br /> <br /> I wasn't sure what I was expecting, but given how my reaction was &quot;duh&quot;, it's not a bad thing. Laughing my ass off at the Crucible Initiative though, who seem to have a blind spot the size of Jupiter.<br /> <br /> I also love how the False wrote their own section. I already hate them! (HARD MONSTERS MAKING HARD DECISIONS)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T13:49:17-07:00","id":1300070,"title":"","content":"I feel like the introduction could use more specifics about what exactly the Contagion IS. I realize there\u2019s a longer section on the history and nature of the Contagion later in the book, but I feel like a brief summary of current events would be useful to provide some context. It\u2019s weird to read about the False and Sworn faction\u2019s reactions to the Contagion without really knowing what they\u2019re reacting TO. A lot of us have been following the hints and previews online, but not everyone picking up the book will have that context. A glossary of new terms would be especially helpful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/40-dspaul","name":"DSPaul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T13:51:32-07:00","id":1300071,"title":"","content":"I'd be surprised if they tell us what the Contagion is. Instead, I'd expect them to keep it vague mostly and maybe give us a list of ideas of what it could be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T13:57:12-07:00","id":1300075,"title":"","content":"Oh, I agree \u2014 I\u2019m talking about the symptoms, not the cause. There are a few examples mentioned \u2014 blood tasting like battery acid, etc. \u2014 but a general overview of the whole phenomenon would be nice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/40-dspaul","name":"DSPaul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T14:03:56-07:00","id":1300080,"title":"","content":"This is something I hope they get right. My favourite game-line is Demon, but until the Players Guide pinning down what infrastructure is was really hard from the core alone as everything was too... nebulous to really go &quot;that's it, that's the threat&quot;. I get the contagion needs to be flexible for your game, but a couple of &quot;Right dumbass - do it like this: X&quot; would be useful to get the ball rolling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Find my Homebrew so far here: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18X_mkFwDcM0sSN9R2GoQ72Q5FqW1deFgEM3HIGneABQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> So far its Demon Merits, Vampire 1e to 2e ports and a Knowledge collection mechanic for the Ordo Dracul!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24597-lordofiron","name":"LordofIron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24597_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T14:09:01-07:00","id":1300083,"title":"","content":"I hear ya, but I imagine they'll nail it down.<br /> <br /> That said, I really dig the groups, particularly the Rosetta Society and the Ship of Theseus on the Sworn side and Naflgar's Army on the False(though the Gambit man, the the Gambit!)-but this doesn't quite deal with my itching teeth the way I want it to. Can't wait for next week, where we can really starting getting into the crossover and the Contagion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T14:09:53-07:00","id":1300084,"title":"","content":"The 12 settings will provide hard examples of how to use the Contagion in a chronicle!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T14:32:14-07:00","id":1300093,"title":"","content":"Rosetta Society's still my favourite, but reading this again (I got to take a peek at this chapter for another project) I am once again struck by how much I absolutely love all of these factions, Sworn and False alike.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T14:43:58-07:00","id":1300101,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300093#post1300093\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rosetta Society's still my favourite, but reading this again (I got to take a peek at this chapter for another project) I am once again struck by how much I absolutely love all of these factions, Sworn and False alike.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah. Each of them is extremely evocative and begs to be played/an antagonist.<br /> <br /> Though I'm not playing as Nagflar's Army, for the same reason I don't see a point in playing Black Crusade.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Clarification; I meant &quot;as&quot;, not &quot;with.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":". 03-26-2019, 06:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T15:05:03-07:00","id":1300109,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300101#post1300101\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Though I'm not playing with Nagflar's Army, for the same reason I don't see a point in playing Black Crusade.</div> </div> </div> </div>Really? I liked it a lot. And it's something Chronicles has managed to avoid so far. Even the Pure aren't entirely of that mindset.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T15:30:23-07:00","id":1300125,"title":"","content":"You know, it strikes me that there\u2019s no sworn faction that primarily views the Contagion as a disease to be healed \u2014 that is, none of them are primarily concerned with helping the infected. The Rosetta Society see it as a scientific puzzle to be solved, but they seem to be driven mostly by the prospect of increasing their OWN knowledge rather than helping others. Zero Hour are explicitly mentioned as trying to save infected when they can, but they fundamentally see things in terms of fighting a war, rather than responding to a (super)natural disaster. The Jeremiad want to redeem \u201csinners,\u201d the Cryptarchy want to set up a quarantine, and the Theseans want to improve their own immune systems \u2014 but nobody seems particularly interested in palliative care. Possibly that\u2019s because it\u2019s too dangerous \u2014 it\u2019s hard to treat someone when they\u2019re trying to eat your face. Possibly it\u2019s a deliberate, thematic choice. These are, after all, monsters we\u2019re talking about. Individual characters may do good, or at least try to, but the CoD rarely paints any large-scale organization as the unambiguous good guys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":40,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/40-dspaul","user":"DSPaul","date":". 03-26-2019, 06:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/40-dspaul","name":"DSPaul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T15:32:54-07:00","id":1300126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300109#post1300109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Really? I liked it a lot. And it's something Chronicles has managed to avoid so far. Even the Pure aren't entirely of that mindset.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Not what I meant. I like them as antagonists, they just sound boring to have as PCs, because the whole point is...being awful while doing nothing. The Army is by assholes, for assholes. Good antagonists, shitty PCs. I can see playing as the Fire-Bearers or Princes, but the Saturnalians? Nope.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T16:07:12-07:00","id":1300129,"title":"","content":"I am actually running a game that will become a contagion chronicle game at some point; three players so far who are all starting out as mortals. They are being run solo games for that essentially is about them becoming supernaturals and getting settled into that role. I have set up several options and paths for em, so they can end up being embraced or devoured or reborn...but also more esoteric options are there. Like becoming a Hero or a Hobgoblin. So this contagion chronicle game could end up becoming very weird with everything from a lost boy, hero and hobgoblin combo to a vampire, mage and werewolf combo.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8100-caedus","name":"Caedus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"300"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T16:31:01-07:00","id":1300134,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caedus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300129#post1300129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am actually running a game that will become a contagion chronicle game at some point; three players so far who are all starting out as mortals. They are being run solo games for that essentially is about them becoming supernaturals and getting settled into that role. I have set up several options and paths for em, so they can end up being embraced or devoured or reborn...but also more esoteric options are there. Like becoming a Hero or a Hobgoblin. So this contagion chronicle game could end up becoming very weird with everything from a lost boy, hero and hobgoblin combo to a vampire, mage and werewolf combo.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I really love how that's supported, too. The Sworn and False aren't even quite ideologies, they're mission statements with unique powers and initiation rites. It doesn't take much to imagine, say, a changeling and a Huntsman both joining Zero Hour to fight against worse oppressors than the Keepers, or a werewolf and an Arisen embracing the apocalyptic mania of Nagflar's Army","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T17:20:11-07:00","id":1300144,"title":"","content":"I really like how the Introduction, at least, makes the Contagion sound like it isn't necessarily just one thing. Well, it might be but I like how it seems like it takes on a wide variety of forms, rather than just some infectious zombie plague. It might be a plague, it might be some weird thing transmitted in Vitae, a glitch in Infrastructure, an infection of the soul, etc.<br /> <br /> It's as if the book is less about, &quot;Here's this singular threat that looms over us&quot; and more, &quot;Here's a variety of threats based around the themes of infection, corruption, and transmitting plagues.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T17:23:38-07:00","id":1300146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300144#post1300144\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really like how the Introduction, at least, makes the Contagion sound like it isn't necessarily just one thing. Well, it might be but I like how it seems like it takes on a wide variety of forms, rather than just some infectious zombie plague. It might be a plague, it might be some weird thing transmitted in Vitae, a glitch in Infrastructure, an infection of the soul, etc.<br /> <br /> It's as if the book is less about, &quot;Here's this singular threat that looms over us&quot; and more, &quot;Here's a variety of threats based around the themes of infection, corruption, and transmitting plagues.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed. That provides a lot more flexibility and interesting plothooks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T17:28:17-07:00","id":1300148,"title":"","content":"What Gentleman Gamer's character creation podcast mentioned that excited me was how Contagion Chronicle is about the supernatural denizens of the Chronicles of Darkness, who are supposedly \u201cin the know\u201d about how the world <i>really</i> works, suffer the same unease when confronting the Contagion as mortals do when they're first confronted by the supernatural. Unfortunately, the Introduction doesn't convert this feeling very well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T17:50:13-07:00","id":1300154,"title":"","content":"Oh, my 40K-addicted brain realized something:<br /> <br /> The Sworn and False are the <i>Mirror Universe Inquisition</i>.<br /> <br /> Think about it. What defines the Sworn are their willingness to compromise, to acknowledge internal problems, to try and make the world a better place even if it's for self-serving reasons of &quot;I don't wanna live in Contagion Hell.&quot; What defines the False is saying &quot;We live in a grimdark universe, screw hope, we're gonna find our corner of the world and make sure it runs the way we want it to in our corner of hell and bite anyone who tries to interfere, because making things better is a sucker's bet.&quot;<br /> <br /> The very embrace of the grimdark, <i>especially </i>the No Compromise Ever mentality of the Fire-Bearers, is what corrupts them. The drive to understand the Contagion, even emphasizing with it in the case of the Theseans and the Rosetta Stone, is what allows the Sworn to examine it without being corrupted by it. Thus, here, Chaos is something that must be <i>understood </i>to be fought; trying to remain &quot;pure&quot; is a good way to be corrupted by it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T22:08:48-07:00","id":1300193,"title":"","content":"It seems like the description of Sworn are somewhat in character rather than an objective overview, but I have to admit that seeing Zero Hour call themselves a modern military and then in the same sentence say they allow for variations in hierarchy based on local culture and tradition made me laugh out loud","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12738-minty","name":"Minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T22:54:15-07:00","id":1300202,"title":"","content":"It would be necessary, considering the threat and who they are, for variation in the different units, especially since their local history would have them prepared to act differently. If you're fighting off a zombie horde that rises every decade you're dealing with some people who can shoot, but if there's just holes that pop up randomly and start swallowing buildings you have completely different people who are going to need to deal with that. I'm not sure if military is the best term for it, I suppose they're closer to Japan's Self Defense Force in real life. But neither group has scientists to shut down portals opening in our world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T06:02:26-07:00","id":1300253,"title":"","content":"Oh,absolutely. A numerically small group with distributed assets like Zero Hour is in no way equipped to be, nor should it try to emulate military culture. I just found it to be a very funny statement. Zero Hour is actually the Sworn group that is most compelling to me. As soon as I read their flavor text at the beginning I went &quot;that's it, these are my guys&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12738-minty","name":"Minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T06:23:44-07:00","id":1300262,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300022#post1300022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The first manuscript release is (of course) the introduction, and the \u201csocial splats\u201d: the Sworn and the False. If the book outline is being followed in order, next week should give us Vectors and Plagues, Interstitial and Otherwise. Following that should be Storytelling, five chapters of Contagious fiction, and Outbreak Sites (a dozen settings worldwide).</div> </div> </div> </div>If Contagion Chronicle will have specific short chapter for each monster race, so with Introduction, Sworn &amp; False, Vectors, settings and storytelling - we will see around 16 chapters ( cause 11 gamelines we have now ) to deliver in previews. With 30 days Kickstarter, it means 2 chapter every 3-4 days ( to have like 8 previews parts in total ). It seems to be confirmed with comment made by James. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300031#post1300031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> James said in the comments we will get our first setting section by Friday.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T12:12:43-07:00","id":1300354,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300262#post1300262\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If Contagion Chronicle will have specific short chapter for each monster race</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think this has been implied to be the case anywhere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T12:41:19-07:00","id":1300362,"title":"","content":"I think at this point, the real question is &quot;What is the structure of the Storytelling chapter?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T14:04:43-07:00","id":1300377,"title":"","content":"So, I'm pretty curious about the setting ideas here, most particularly in how this is all seen through the eyes of people not aware of the supernatural world. With the Division 2 being out, I'm kind of wondering if there might be anything from there that might be applicable as good inspiration.<br /> <br /> What do people think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/851-paradim","name":"Paradim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T14:12:11-07:00","id":1300379,"title":"","content":"I haven't played it, but it looks like you can easily have Contagion cause apocalypse scenarios leading to post apocalypse settings, or through interstitial terrain bring otherwise non-apocalyptic people into post apocalyptic scenarios. The pseudo-world from 12 Photographs way back in the Horror Recognition Guide seems like it would be pretty video gamey.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T14:17:22-07:00","id":1300381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Paradim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300377#post1300377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I'm pretty curious about the setting ideas here, most particularly in how this is all seen through the eyes of people not aware of the supernatural world. With the Division 2 being out, I'm kind of wondering if there might be anything from there that might be applicable as good inspiration.<br /> <br /> What do people think?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I know I'm mining it for my Post-Contagion Apocalypse setting - or more accurately, my Post-The Sworn Realized They Weren't Going To Win And Successfully Stalemated The End Of Days setting. Humanity's doing fine, but Division DC is an excellent example of what the urban areas that weren't safe look like when ravaged by a more minor strain and still inhabited by survivor communities (major strain ravaged areas tend to look like something out of Destiny if nice). The SHD is what I'm looking to when running Zero Hour as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T14:19:35-07:00","id":1300382,"title":"","content":"So far, this really isn\u2019t grabbing me. It feels as though \u201cThe Contagion\u201d, in an attempt to be something to everyone, has turned out to be nothing to anyone. <br /> <br /> That may just be an inevitable consequence of trying to create something that could handle any combination of game lines, up to and including all of them, and maybe it\u2019ll look better after more content has been released, but right now I\u2019m having trouble seeing it work well as e.g. \u201cA Werewolf + Promethean game\u201d rather than \u201cA game with werewolves and prometheans in it.\u201d <br /> <br /> I\u2019m not shocked, because we knew for a long time that this was how it would be, but it\u2019s still disappointing. Maybe they\u2019ll do a second book, with a different approach, if this one goes well, but as someone mentioned upthread, it may just be that I should stick to Dark Eras for content like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24885-callmesalticidae","name":"Callmesalticidae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24885_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T15:05:38-07:00","id":1300397,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Callmesalticidae</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300382#post1300382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So far, this really isn\u2019t grabbing me. It feels as though \u201cThe Contagion\u201d, in an attempt to be something to everyone, has turned out to be nothing to anyone. <br /> <br /> That may just be an inevitable consequence of trying to create something that could handle any combination of game lines, up to and including all of them, and maybe it\u2019ll look better after more content has been released, but right now I\u2019m having trouble seeing it work well as e.g. \u201cA Werewolf + Promethean game\u201d rather than \u201cA game with werewolves and prometheans in it.\u201d <br /> <br /> I\u2019m not shocked, because we knew for a long time that this was how it would be, but it\u2019s still disappointing. Maybe they\u2019ll do a second book, with a different approach, if this one goes well, but as someone mentioned upthread, it may just be that I should stick to Dark Eras for content like that.</div> </div> </div> </div>ok that last part. dont say we all expected one thing. the contagion is open ended so we cant just say &quot;oh it's a fucked up God machine&quot;. Otherwise I can understand why you think the part about &quot;a game with werewolves and prometheans&quot;. But I (and many others) will see how the game continues. besides, it is noted the settings will go into crossover between some combinations supernaturals","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T15:12:55-07:00","id":1300398,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Callmesalticidae</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300382#post1300382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So far, this really isn\u2019t grabbing me. It feels as though \u201cThe Contagion\u201d, in an attempt to be something to everyone, has turned out to be nothing to anyone.<br /> <br /> That may just be an inevitable consequence of trying to create something that could handle any combination of game lines, up to and including all of them, and maybe it\u2019ll look better after more content has been released, but right now I\u2019m having trouble seeing it work well as e.g. \u201cA Werewolf + Promethean game\u201d rather than \u201cA game with werewolves and prometheans in it.\u201d<br /> <br /> I\u2019m not shocked, because we knew for a long time that this was how it would be, but it\u2019s still disappointing. Maybe they\u2019ll do a second book, with a different approach, if this one goes well, but as someone mentioned upthread, it may just be that I should stick to Dark Eras for content like that.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I would recommend giving the kickstarter a little more time to reveal more information, instead of making any judgement right now. We really don't know much yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/851-paradim","name":"Paradim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T15:16:29-07:00","id":1300400,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Callmesalticidae</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300382#post1300382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So far, this really isn\u2019t grabbing me. It feels as though \u201cThe Contagion\u201d, in an attempt to be something to everyone, has turned out to be nothing to anyone.</div> </div> </div> </div>Seems a bit early to make that call when what 'The Contagion' appears as has literally not been shared yet in any of its hard examples.<br /> <br /> While it's clearly something you can use for different situations, they've repeatedly pointed out that there's going to be specific examples of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T15:57:48-07:00","id":1300407,"title":"","content":"oh, and unless I'm mistaken, the fact the contagion could be multiple things allow things likes the geryo strain much easier to have in a Forsaken game without feeling like it needs a crossover (geryo are supposed to have something connected to the contagion right?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T17:59:05-07:00","id":1300433,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300397#post1300397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ok that last part. dont say we all expected one thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's fair. My post was not phrased as clearly as it could have been. What I mean is that we've gotten hints about how this book was going to play out, and so far what we have gotten is consistent with those hints. Some people are going to like that, and other people are not. I did not mean to imply that &quot;what we all expected&quot; was something negative. Rather, &quot;what we all expected&quot; was basic facts about the chronicle, which some people would like and other people would dislike. <br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Paradim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300398#post1300398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would recommend giving the kickstarter a little more time to reveal more information, instead of making any judgement right now. We really don't know much yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300400#post1300400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Seems a bit early to make that call when what 'The Contagion' appears as has literally not been shared yet in any of its hard examples.<br /> <br /> While it's clearly something you can use for different situations, they've repeatedly pointed out that there's going to be specific examples of it.</div> </div> </div> </div>If I'm wrong, then I'm wrong, and I'll own up to it, but we <i>have</i> gotten a sense of what the Contagion is, and it seems closer to an out-of-context threat that doesn't fit neatly into most of the game lines (it'll probably work really well for Mage and Demon, and it could potentially fit well into Deviant, based on what we know of that one so far). I'm not saying, &quot;The Contagion Chronicle is crap and everyone involved in it should be fired.&quot; I personally don't think that it's going to be valuable for me (though I've ponied up the $5 for previews precisely <i>because </i>I'm giving Onyx Path a chance), but it obviously wasn't a &quot;bad&quot; decision for them to make because OP is a company that needs to make money and, judging by the campaign's success thus far, this is going to make them some money.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24885-callmesalticidae","name":"Callmesalticidae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24885_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T18:04:54-07:00","id":1300434,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Callmesalticidae</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300433#post1300433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's fair. My post was not phrased as clearly as it could have been. What I mean is that we've gotten hints about how this book was going to play out, and so far what we have gotten is consistent with those hints. Some people are going to like that, and other people are not. I did not mean to imply that &amp;quot;what we all expected&amp;quot; was something negative. Rather, &amp;quot;what we all expected&amp;quot; was basic facts about the chronicle, which some people would like and other people would dislike. <br /> <br /> \u200b<br /> <br /> \u200b<br /> <br /> If I'm wrong, then I'm wrong, and I'll own up to it, but we <i>have</i> gotten a sense of what the Contagion is, and it seems closer to an out-of-context threat that doesn't fit neatly into most of the game lines (it'll probably work really well for Mage and Demon, and it could potentially fit well into Deviant, based on what we know of that one so far). I'm not saying, &amp;quot;The Contagion Chronicle is crap and everyone involved in it should be fired.&amp;quot; I personally don't think that it's going to be valuable for me (though I've ponied up the $5 for previews precisely <i>because </i>I'm giving Onyx Path a chance), but it obviously wasn't a &amp;quot;bad&amp;quot; decision for them to make because OP is a company that needs to make money and, judging by the campaign's success thus far, this is going to make them some money.</div> </div> </div> </div>fair enough. sorry that I thought you intended we all had the same expectation.<br /> <br /> well I do believe you when you say you are giving it a chance. one thing we do know is that the contagion and geryo have a connection that causes werewolves shifting abilities to go batshit. I think once we get settings and enemies we can see how the contagion could fit with the other chronicles","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T07:05:28-07:00","id":1300542,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/contagion-chronicle-a-chronicles-of-darkness-cross/posts/2460829\" target=\"_blank\">First part of Edinburg is up today</a>, will have full chapter tomorrow.<br /> <br /> Apparently, the prime Contagious for the Edinburg Blood-Plague is...an Arisen, actually. His name's Iufenamun, and he's converted the National Museum of Scotland into a Dionysan temple he hopes to make the heart of a new Irem. The end-state of his Contagion seems to be his revelers turning into a legion of ghosts bound to his will.<br /> <br /> And I'm thinking <i>goddammit why didn't we get the core Contagion rules first this would be really informative if we knew how it worked.</i><br /> <br /> As it is, it's interesting that he became, well...Daeva-like when he became patient zero for the Edinburg strain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T08:55:06-07:00","id":1300561,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300542#post1300542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/contagion-chronicle-a-chronicles-of-darkness-cross/posts/2460829&amp;quot;]First</a> part of Edinburg is up today[/URL], will have full chapter tomorrow.<br /> <br /> Apparently, the prime Contagious for the Edinburg Blood-Plague is...an Arisen, actually. His name's Iufenamun, and he's converted the National Museum of Scotland into a Dionysan temple he hopes to make the heart of a new Irem. The end-state of his Contagion seems to be his revelers turning into a legion of ghosts bound to his will.<br /> <br /> And I'm thinking <i>goddammit why didn't we get the core Contagion rules first this would be really informative if we knew how it worked.</i><br /> <br /> As it is, it's interesting that he became, well...Daeva-like when he became patient zero for the Edinburg strain.</div> </div> </div> </div> Yeah it's pretty cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T09:34:42-07:00","id":1300569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300542#post1300542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And I'm thinking <i>goddammit why didn't we get the core Contagion rules first this would be really informative if we knew how it worked.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>*idly side-eyes the Chronicles Theme of dark mystery*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T09:47:47-07:00","id":1300572,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300542#post1300542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Apparently, the prime Contagious for the Edinburg Blood-Plague is...an Arisen, actually. His name's Iufenamun, and he's converted the National Museum of Scotland into a Dionysan temple he hopes to make the heart of a new Irem. The end-state of his Contagion seems to be his revelers turning into a legion of ghosts bound to his will.</div> </div> </div> </div>It notes that while the mummy's arrival seemed to kick things off with the Contagion, 'The God-Machine\u2019s response is a widespread antivirus, though it may do more harm than good.' Which is probably where it ties into blood.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T12:43:01-07:00","id":1300638,"title":"","content":"On Edinburgh I'm somehow... dissatisfied. If whole Contagion is 'local mummy doing one weird thing' - I'm disappointed. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I was hoping for something on much larger strokes on city than 'Night in Museum' ending with some ghosts. However, it's pointed that vampires are connected to it, so we only seen part of Edinburgh preview. Will see tomorrow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-28-2019, 03:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T12:49:52-07:00","id":1300643,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300572#post1300572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It notes that while the mummy's arrival seemed to kick things off with the Contagion, 'The God-Machine\u2019s response is a widespread antivirus, though it may do more harm than good.' Which is probably where it ties into blood.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that and the other Contagion strain carried by lifesuckers including vampires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T13:03:46-07:00","id":1300645,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300638#post1300638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On Edinburgh I'm somehow... dissatisfied. If whole Contagion is 'local mummy doing one weird thing' - I'm disappointed. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I was hoping for something on much larger strokes on city than 'Night in Museum' ending with some ghosts. However, it's pointed that vampires are connected to it, so we only seen part of Edinburgh preview. Will see tomorrow.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah gotta say it's not a great preview, purely because it lacks context rather than actually being bad material. I can't help but feel kinda confused about the whole nature of the &quot;contagion&quot; rather than intrigued but hopefully the full version will shed some light tomorrow and if not it'll hopefully make more sense as more of the core content for the book is revealed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25080-kargle18446","name":"Kargle18446","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T13:51:54-07:00","id":1300661,"title":"","content":"I'm getting the vague feeling I'm the only one whose main question is &quot;Okay, let's see where this goes.&quot;<br /> <br /> It's not just that Iufenamun's <i>weird</i>, it's that <i>his presence</i> seems warped towards a vampiric nature <i>which mummies aren't quite inclined to crossing powersets with</i>. What's more is that this is a pretty brazen display against the Law of Shadow, more brazen than even the White Jackal played at. Why the hell isn't this mummy afraid of what his peers will do?<br /> <br /> There's something <i>odd</i> about all of this, something off kilter, and I wanna see where this goes, at least.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T14:20:52-07:00","id":1300666,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300661#post1300661\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm getting the vague feeling I'm the only one whose main question is &quot;Okay, let's see where this goes.&quot;<br /> <br /> It's not just that Iufenamun's <i>weird</i>, it's that <i>his presence</i> seems warped towards a vampiric nature <i>which mummies aren't quite inclined to crossing powersets with</i>. What's more is that this is a pretty brazen display against the Law of Shadow, more brazen than even the White Jackal played at. Why the hell isn't this mummy afraid of what his peers will do?<br /> <br /> There's something <i>odd</i> about all of this, something off kilter, and I wanna see where this goes, at least.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm right there with you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T14:30:07-07:00","id":1300670,"title":"","content":"Mysteries! They don't present their answers immediately, folks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T14:30:27-07:00","id":1300672,"title":"","content":"I have to admit I\u2019m also slightly disappointed by the uncoordinated, disjointed nature of what we\u2019ve seen so far. It has the loose, \u201ctoolkit\u201d feel of the early first edition CoD games. I prefer the tighter, more focused feel of the 2e revisions, so this feels like a step backwards. Beast had the same problem. (It\u2019s not the ONLY problem Beast had, but let\u2019s not get into that right now.) <br /> <br /> I realize the dilemma the designers were in \u2014 they have twelve different game lines to coordinate, and finite time and resources (and page count!) with which to do so. Not to mention that each game has its own distinct themes and its own perspective on the common setting. It\u2019s very difficult to do full justice to all of them without someone feeling left out. \u201cMage Supremecy\u201d (or whatever) works for a book in the Mage line or a campaign where most PCs are mages, but if you try to apply it on a larger scale... well, there\u2019s a reason why WoD fandom at its height was so prone to crossover-related flame wars, and why earlier CoD development took such a cautious attitude towards the issue. But you can\u2019t be all things to all people, and at some point you\u2019ve got to decide where to focus your attention.<br /> <br /> I may be too pessemistic. We\u2019ve still only seen a few short previews of the book, and it\u2019s quite possible things will really start to click when we get more context. Even in the worst-case scenario, I\u2019m sure there\u2019ll be plenty of interesting material to borrow or adapt to my own games. But what we\u2019ve seen so far doesn\u2019t grab me quite as hard as I was expecting.<br /> <br /> (I was harping about the Introduction earlier because, in my experience, that\u2019s the best place for the \u201celevator pitch.\u201d You know \u2014 \u201cHe\u2019s a vampire, she\u2019s a werewolf, they fight Cronenbergian mutants created by a mysterious virus!\u201d Not necessarily a detailed summary, but something that gives first time readers a concrete idea of what to expect. Right now, the Contagion Chronicle doesn\u2019t really HAVE that. I\u2019d be a lot more confident if it did,)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/40-dspaul","name":"DSPaul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T14:39:54-07:00","id":1300676,"title":"","content":"as you said in the 3rd paragraph, let's have patience. the contagion is supposed to have a number of forms and effects and the game is in a very young state right now. as we know, the mage supremacy thing may actually (or really, should be) be circumvented as the contagion can do things such as give normal humans the power of mages (going from a pastor's words having the same effect as mages spells)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T15:05:21-07:00","id":1300680,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300661#post1300661\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm getting the vague feeling I'm the only one whose main question is &quot;Okay, let's see where this goes.&quot;<br /> <br /> It's not just that Iufenamun's <i>weird</i>, it's that <i>his presence</i> seems warped towards a vampiric nature <i>which mummies aren't quite inclined to crossing powersets with</i>. What's more is that this is a pretty brazen display against the Law of Shadow, more brazen than even the White Jackal played at. Why the hell isn't this mummy afraid of what his peers will do?<br /> <br /> There's something <i>odd</i> about all of this, something off kilter, and I wanna see where this goes, at least.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You aren't the only one. I just think the previews should have included a &quot;What Does The Contagion Do&quot; sidebar first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T15:05:53-07:00","id":1300681,"title":"","content":"I feel that we might have been expecting the contagion to be something. But having read multiple of these books can you say that Vampire defines a vampire? Or Mage defines a mage?<br /> <br /> Maybe this book is like all the others: freeform possibility of a conflict that would require a group of supernaturals to tackle, understand, use, stave off?<br /> <br /> A new chapter to add to our many stories.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24020-mateus","name":"Mateus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24020_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T15:09:11-07:00","id":1300683,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300661#post1300661\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm getting the vague feeling I'm the only one whose main question is &quot;Okay, let's see where this goes.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Seriously.<br /> <br /> We've been doing this for, how many KSs now? Why are we still making absolute judgement calls on only pieces of the work without having the full work available for context?<br /> <br /> Calm down people.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://media.giphy.com/media/l0HlKrB02QY0f1mbm/giphy.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T19:44:22-07:00","id":1300733,"title":"","content":"This so far seems to be positing an iteration of the CofD world in which the supernatural splats are on the whole more clued in about each other than usual, and I like that. Though I suspect some of the smaller and more extreme groups would have trouble surviving in a more open environment.<br /> <br /> ...the Crucible is bothering me a bit, because all the other False faction writeups make it very clear how each of them is using the Contagion to get what they want, while the Crucible writeup seems to me to be making it very <i>very</i> clear that they would rather gnaw their collective arms off than do anything other than destroy or quarantine anything that <i>might</i> be contaminated. They don't fit with the Sworn, but they don't appear False either? Or am I missing something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25206-evil-midnight-lurker","name":"Evil Midnight Lurker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25206_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T19:55:58-07:00","id":1300736,"title":"","content":"I think there's some irony in the fact that they are so vehemently against the Contagion that they're part of a coalition devoted to its existence (even if their goal is the end of its existence).<br /> <br /> They would at least have knowledge of the Contagion, so they would be able to tell what to look out for. But they seem to exist in a pretty clear antagonist space. In the stories about a monster rampage, alien invasion, or some sort of disease, <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/NukeEm\" target=\"_blank\">they are the ones pushing for the nuclear option, to get rid of everything</a>, while the others are the people who would be pointing out that there's people in there who can be saved, there's so much to learn about it, that a nuclear option might not work, or even might make things worse. Though obviously there's always the chance in a specific situation that the Crucible's way is the only way, however horrible the circumstances may be for the PCs.<br /> <br /> It looks like in the history chapter (and the settings) we'll see how some of the factions have butted heads in the past, and how deep their knowledge goes, or doesn't. While something like the Rosetta Society likely shares knowledge among its members, it's probably not something they spread to others in their y-splats (Order, covenant, whatever) freely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 03-28-2019, 11:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T19:59:58-07:00","id":1300738,"title":"","content":"Changeling Bridge Burners, but writ-large.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T20:25:26-07:00","id":1300741,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300736#post1300736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think there's some irony in the fact that they are so vehemently against the Contagion that they're part of a coalition devoted to its existence (even if their goal is the end of its existence).</div> </div> </div> </div>See, that's my problem. I'm not seeing any reason at all for them to be part of the False and not fighting them tooth and nail.<br /> <br /> Absolute contradiction isn't irony, and the <i>only</i> thing I'm seeing is absolute contradiction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25206-evil-midnight-lurker","name":"Evil Midnight Lurker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25206_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T20:33:27-07:00","id":1300742,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evil Midnight Lurker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300741#post1300741\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">See, that's my problem. I'm not seeing any reason at all for them to be part of the False and not fighting them tooth and nail.<br /> <br /> Absolute contradiction isn't irony, and the <i>only</i> thing I'm seeing is absolute contradiction.</div> </div> </div> </div>They're False for the same reason Bridge Burners are &quot;loyalists&quot;-they're not, really, but they're so damn destructive you can't easily claim them as Sworn. Reality has gotta be left standing for it to be a meaningful attitude, and the Initiative....kind of sucks at that.<br /> <br /> Besides, some of this depends on what, exactly, Contagion can do as a Vector. THey might still utilize it in a way that is counter to Sworn perspectives even if it fulfills theirs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T20:37:04-07:00","id":1300743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evil Midnight Lurker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300741#post1300741\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">See, that's my problem. I'm not seeing any reason at all for them to be part of the False and not fighting them tooth and nail.</div> </div> </div> </div>The False isn't like an organized coalition. The different groups are, but it's not as if they've all signed a False Agreement. It seems more like the Left-Handed in Mage (or as ArcaneArts says, calling Bridgeburners loyalists), labeling them False is an easy way to say 'They're the people who don't do what we want.' Or 'they're wrong.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T20:41:08-07:00","id":1300744,"title":"","content":"Aren't the False organizations also <i>defined</i> as using Contagion directly? Because if they are, then I find the classification hard to swallow in light of their writeup. If not, then I can calm down.<br /> <br /> Sorry about this. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25206-evil-midnight-lurker","name":"Evil Midnight Lurker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25206_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T21:00:00-07:00","id":1300746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evil Midnight Lurker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300744#post1300744\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aren't the False organizations also <i>defined</i> as using Contagion directly? Because if they are, then I find the classification hard to swallow in light of their writeup. If not, then I can calm down.</div> </div> </div> </div>It doesn't seem to be something they're defined by as much as something these groups can do. The history section will likely talk about past False organizations and delve more into origins for the terms.<br /> <br /> 'Vector: Contagion. All False wield dominion over the Contagion itself, each in their own ways.'<br /> <br /> We have no idea what Vectors are (I think it's in next Tuesday's release) but you can see in the examples of <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/the-crucible-initiative-contagion-chronicle/\" target=\"_blank\">'Who We Are'</a> how some of them already use the Contagion to find more ways to seek it out or help destroy it, specifically the alchemist and Ordo Dracul, and more implied by the angel and Insatiable.<br /> <br /> No need to be sorry. Wanting to know more is great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 03-29-2019, 12:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T21:05:52-07:00","id":1300748,"title":"","content":"Crucible Initiative is also Cheiron Group - and we know why they work that way. They say they hunting monsters, saving world - but in reality, they take out monsters body parts, for themselves. To me that is majority of Crucible - they SAY they are saving world from Contagion - when, in reality, they gain knowledge and power. Even their best \u2018virulogist\u2019 is best in \u2018taking care off of Contagion\u2019, because, in secret, he want\u2019s to know EVERYTHING about this thing. He is ready to infect people or monsters to understand it, as we seen in preview. Group started as Angels and Werewolves alliance, so they driven by destruction of target \u2013 but it\u2019s not that they only do this to killing things. It\u2019s EXACTLY as with Sacred Hunt in Werewolves themselves \u2013 they NEED to do this, but they make it from much more reasons than simple bloodshed. In that light - yes, Crucible are False in using Contagion as a tool - tool to better themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T22:24:12-07:00","id":1300768,"title":"","content":"As I understand it, the False are defined more by what they <i>don't</i> have: they don't have Vectors. Which, when we finally get to see them (Monday?), I suspect will turn out to be rooted in the Contagion somehow. That would be why the Crucible doesn't have a Vector: they're <i>so</i> anti-Contagion that they reject even special anti-Contagion countermeasures as a form of the Contagion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T02:54:35-07:00","id":1300784,"title":"","content":"Always nice to see conjecture about a game I've developed, but yes, please do be patient with the fact we're releasing this book chapter by chapter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T03:48:32-07:00","id":1300792,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300743#post1300743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The False isn't like an organized coalition. The different groups are, but it's not as if they've all signed a False Agreement. It seems more like the Left-Handed in Mage (or as ArcaneArts says, calling Bridgeburners loyalists), labeling them False is an easy way to say 'They're the people who don't do what we want.' Or 'they're wrong.'</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, this. The False groups don't consider themselves colleagues or anything, and any of them who actually use the word &quot;False&quot; to describe themselves are only doing it to differentiate themselves from the Sworn, whom they tend to view as naive or just straight up wrong. Their defining features are: not working together with everyone else to get rid of the Contagion, and using the Contagion as a weapon or a tool to some end, whether that's to end the world in chaos or figure out how best to eradicate everything remotely or potentially related to it on the planet.<br /> <br /> Sworn vs. False is largely an attitude thing and a Vectors thing, as a few people have noted already. Are you willing to swear yourself to a group of like-minded individuals who want to fix the world and develop specialized powers to combat Contagion? Cool, you're Sworn. Do you think those people are ridiculous or tragically ill-fated, and that it's totally fine to use the Contagion itself in your efforts to react to it however you plan to react to it? That makes you False. The line can certainly get fuzzy, and as noted in the preview, characters can go from Sworn to False and back under various circumstances; but for instance, you're far more likely to see very antagonistic types like Strix or Scelesti among the False, because most of them either won't be willing to swear themselves to the kinds of group accountability and teamwork the Sworn get up to, or won't be <i>welcome</i> by those who are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Meghan Fitzgerald | Onyx Path freelance writer &amp; developer</i><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><i>Changeling: The Lost developer</i></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#009999\"><i>Mage: The Awakening developer</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2229-meghan-fitzgerald","name":"Meghan Fitzgerald","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"124"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T04:12:13-07:00","id":1300797,"title":"","content":"Worth also noting that if you're False, you may well own the name. &quot;If those other pricks are going to be arrogant enough to call themselves 'Sworn' then fuck them.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T05:53:02-07:00","id":1300809,"title":"","content":"Edinburgh setting is in it's fullest now for backers. It's 17 pages long, so it seems that each Contagion settings are chapter of book on it's own. Setting is with subsections of Theme and Mood, What Has Come Before, Where We Are, Cause ( probably of this outbreak of Contagion ), Symptom ( with Outbreak Sites and Story Hooks subsections ), (this particular setting have ) In Court of Infenamum - where described are Mummies and Sin-Eaters - and, finally, section Cure that is divided between all Sworn and False. At the end are Rumors in the area.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-29-2019, 08:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T06:21:26-07:00","id":1300813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300809#post1300809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edinburgh setting is in it's fullest now for backers. It's 17 pages long, so it seems that each Contagion settings are chapter of book on it's own.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is amazing. Reading it now, and damn. This is great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T06:25:45-07:00","id":1300815,"title":"","content":"And we have the full purview for <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/contagion-chronicle-a-chronicles-of-darkness-cross/updates\" target=\"_blank\">Edinburg</a>.<br /> <br /> I've just started reading it, and here's something interesting:<br /> <br /> Iufenamun is <i>not </i>a Contagious, or at least not initially one. He's the main antagonist, yes, but he actually was drawn to the Contagion, which here manifests as Blightfang - a disease that turns people into vampires without the Embrace, and the Grey, the plague the God-Machine made to thin out Blightfang Kindred numbers. He showed up because he thinks he can use the Blightfangs as his army, and he wants to exploit the Reality Bleed effect it has to pull in a world where the Nameless Empire never fell to serve as the capital of a new one. Also, &quot;define what the Contagion symptoms are&quot; seems to be key when designing a setting. We have Blightfangs and Reality Bleed, of course, but it's explicit that's hardly the only one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T06:30:43-07:00","id":1300816,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300815#post1300815\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And we have the full purview for <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/contagion-chronicle-a-chronicles-of-darkness-cross/updates\" target=\"_blank\">Edinburg</a>.<br /> <br /> I've just started reading it, and here's something interesting:<br /> <br /> Iufenamun is <i>not </i>a Contagious, or at least not initially one. He's the main antagonist, yes, but he actually was drawn to the Contagion, which here manifests as Blightfang - a disease that turns people into vampires without the Embrace, and the Grey, the plague the God-Machine made to thin out Blightfang Kindred numbers. He showed up because he thinks he can use the Blightfangs as his army, and he wants to exploit the Reality Bleed effect it has to pull in a world where the Nameless Empire never fell to serve as the capital of a new one. Also, &quot;define what the Contagion symptoms are&quot; seems to be key when designing a setting. We have Blightfangs and Reality Bleed, of course, but it's explicit that's hardly the only one.</div> </div> </div> </div>waitta minnute. If this particular mummy didn't gain his power due to the Contagion,does it mean ALL mummies can become this powerful?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T06:40:44-07:00","id":1300817,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300816#post1300816\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">waitta minnute. If this particular mummy didn't gain his power due to the Contagion,does it mean ALL mummies can become this powerful?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Possibly, but I think his Master of Memory thing may be due to him harnessing the Contagion; he has the ability to steal Memory in return for Sekhem, which means he's Sekhem 10 and Memory 10 (since he can sacrifice some of his new Memory to boost his own batteries). That's...frightening.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T06:46:08-07:00","id":1300818,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300817#post1300817\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Possibly, but I think his Master of Memory thing may be due to him harnessing the Contagion; he has the ability to steal Memory in return for Sekhem, which means he's Sekhem 10 and Memory 10 (since he can sacrifice some of his new Memory to boost his own batteries). That's...frightening.</div> </div> </div> </div>holy molly,i didn't even consider that,it *is* frightening.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T06:49:41-07:00","id":1300820,"title":"","content":"I gotta say i absolutely love the write up, loads of great story hooks and potential plot development.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25080,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25080-kargle18446","user":"Kargle18446","date":". 03-29-2019, 12:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25080-kargle18446","name":"Kargle18446","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T06:56:27-07:00","id":1300821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300818#post1300818\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">holy molly,i didn't even consider that,it *is* frightening.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, any story about Contagion Edinburg is going to involve a story about the demigod that is in the process of learning how to run it. Especially since after another check, he seems to be a native of an alternate universe opened up by the Contagion, one where Amun is a Judge of Duat. Which is way more interesting than just everything being Ten Photographs from Philadelphia all the time (since Iufenamun, while an amoral and diabolic bastard, is an extremely human one as opposed to an alien god; apart from the cultural differences and the Judge he's a normal Su-Menet).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T07:03:48-07:00","id":1300827,"title":"","content":"So, Edinburgh is fucking <i>amazing</i>. I love everything about the setting.<br /> <br /> For anyone else that notices the mechanical nitpick that I did - that one section mentions making a <i>standard difficulty</i> roll, and then goes on to detail the results of failure - rolls the next day suffer <i>+1 difficulty</i>or <i>+2 difficulty</i><b>, </b>despite that not being a system term in CofD:<br /> <br /> It's been clarified that this isn't target number changing, and will be clarified.<br /> So if you're like me and not a fan of target number shenanigans, rest easy - it hasn't stealthed its way into CofD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3570,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","user":"lnodiv","date":". 03-29-2019, 10:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T07:44:28-07:00","id":1300834,"title":"","content":"Likewise, I've identified World of Darkness terminology leaking in, so that'll be addressed before release. Don't worry!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T08:06:30-07:00","id":1300843,"title":"","content":"Little do they know,the Contagion is nothing less than the World of Darkness intruding over the Chronicles of Darkness \ud83d\ude0b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T09:47:49-07:00","id":1300864,"title":"","content":"Yikes, this is a pretty nasty Contagion outbreak in Edinburgh. The rules need some tidying up to fit better in Chronicles but it's easy to see how this could rapidly become an issue for everyone in Edinburgh and supernaturals across Scotland and the UK. The plot hooks at the end are solid. I think the views from the faction characters are a great add but maybe need more distinct personality for the different members. Carl's a nice touch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T10:20:03-07:00","id":1300870,"title":"","content":"Also, the Contagion seems to be affecting the thread.<br /> <br /> It still thinks Evil Midnight Lurker is the last poster.<br /> <br /> (Bug report, I know, but this is too fitting to not note).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T11:50:43-07:00","id":1300892,"title":"","content":"Amazing what context does, ain't it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T12:49:54-07:00","id":1300912,"title":"","content":"If nothing else, I have the Tomb Kings stand-in for the Post Contagion Apocalypse <br /> <br /> &quot;There is the islands, but there is no United Kingdom anymore. Sand covers the tors. Papyrus competes with pines. The Thames is pure and hippopotami are a danger to its sailors. Temples to Re, Amun, and Sekhmet stand proudly next to what was once the Houses of Parliament.<br /> <br /> &quot;There is no King or Queen now. Only the Emperor of the Ashen Lands. <br /> <br /> &quot;Only Iufenamun.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Before you ask; it's not a natural effect or an unintended side effect - nor is it a great scheme. He just realized he wasn't going to reign in Irem and he got homesick. Yes, this is a rather banal reason to utterly devastate the natural ecology of the region.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T12:59:17-07:00","id":1300918,"title":"","content":"Sploosh - I'm in. Love it. Love it. LOVE IT.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Find my Homebrew so far here: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18X_mkFwDcM0sSN9R2GoQ72Q5FqW1deFgEM3HIGneABQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> So far its Demon Merits, Vampire 1e to 2e ports and a Knowledge collection mechanic for the Ordo Dracul!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24597-lordofiron","name":"LordofIron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24597_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T13:27:30-07:00","id":1300929,"title":"","content":"There are a couple sentences in the Geist section that seem like they have the definition of Geist and Sin-Eater flipped, unless I am just misunderstanding what they are trying to convey. For example,<br /> &quot;Dead-Swarms do not possess any of the usual abilities of fully-fledged Sin-Eaters, they have merely enough presence in the Twilight to possess mortals and control their actions for a single scene.&quot;<br /> To me this sounds like they are comparing the abilities of the Dead-Swarms to Geists, rather than the Bound.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12738-minty","name":"Minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T13:29:37-07:00","id":1300931,"title":"","content":"Yo <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar180_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"180\" data-vbnamecard=\"180\">Leliel</a> now that we know about the Sworn and False,will Sir Night join any of them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-29T14:14:58-07:00","id":1300944,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1300931#post1300931\" rel=