tps://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/contagion-chronicle-a-chronicles-of-darkness-cross/posts/2465992\" target=\"_blank\">Vector preview.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T08:11:09-07:00","id":1301631,"title":"","content":"Thank you <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar152_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"152\" data-vbnamecard=\"152\">The Gentleman Gamer</a> !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24020-mateus","name":"Mateus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24020_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T08:39:56-07:00","id":1301640,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evil Midnight Lurker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1301541#post1301541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, that seems reasonable, I can wrap my head around it now. Thanks!</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm still not really convinced. While never a particularly popular saint, King Knud is considered a saint in Roman Catholicism and is the patron saint of Denmark. Dying at the altar is actually a very good way to get yourself canonized in late Medieval Christianity. I'm personally not the biggest fan of taking a canonized saint (however controversial) of a living religion and making him the big bad, so I personally would probably swap things around if I ever ran Odense. Perhaps everyone thinks Knud is the cause but it's actual his betrayer (who became a vampire in a similar way to Longinus becoming a vampire because he pierced the side of Christ, e.g. it makes sense as a curse and everyone *thinking* it's Knud running around provides a nice red herring. <br /> <br /> I'm still a little puzzled as to why the God-Machine even cares about transitioning Denmark from Norse Paganism to Catholicism. Does anyone have any ideas? <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25193-ethawyn","name":"ethawyn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T08:59:36-07:00","id":1301643,"title":"","content":"because the spirts that feed off the Norse gods worship where getting ro powerful and upity","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T09:06:26-07:00","id":1301645,"title":"","content":"I mean that's kinda the God-Machines whole thing, who knows why it needs something to happen, it just does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25080-kargle18446","name":"Kargle18446","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T09:07:49-07:00","id":1301646,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ethawyn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1301640#post1301640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm still a little puzzled as to why the God-Machine even cares about transitioning Denmark from Norse Paganism to Catholicism. Does anyone have any ideas?</div> </div> </div> </div>It might be easier to con people into blindly following a singular, monolithic entity like the God-Machine if they are already monotheists rather than polytheists?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12738-minty","name":"Minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T09:10:18-07:00","id":1301648,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ethawyn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1301640#post1301640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm still a little puzzled as to why the God-Machine even cares about transitioning Denmark from Norse Paganism to Catholicism. Does anyone have any ideas?</div> </div> </div> </div>The God Machine seems to prefer Abrahamic Religions, it makes it easier to operate in (what with its hosts of angels and superficial similarities). Also as a global phenomenon, getting everyone on the same page is sort of helpful for it, makes manipulation more efficient.<br /> <br /> There could be a lot more reasons, like it was the first part in a plan to make Denmark a world superpower by the 2000s so it could survive WW3 in 2012. Once one domino got out of line, though, so did all the others.<br /> <br /> As a separate note (or perhaps not!) there's an upcoming Contagion Q&amp;A. So if you have questions, you can post them <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=axvrFeQOvEg\" target=\"_blank\">in the link for the video.</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=axvrFeQOvEg\" data-code=\"axvrFeQOvEg\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/axvrFeQOvEg/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 04-01-2019, 12:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T09:12:57-07:00","id":1301650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1301646#post1301646\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It might be easier to con people into blindly following a singular, monolithic entity like the God-Machine if they are already monotheists rather than polytheists?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Maybe I'm mis-remembering, but I didn't think the God Machine particularly cared about followers. My understanding was that God Machine cults sprung up from people who discovered Infrastructure and decided to worship it, but not from any particular design of the Machine (ala Cthulhu and those who worship him).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25193-ethawyn","name":"ethawyn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T09:24:17-07:00","id":1301654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1301648#post1301648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As a separate note (or perhaps not!) there's an upcoming Contagion Q&amp;A. So if you have questions, you can post them <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=axvrFeQOvEg\" target=\"_blank\">in the link for the video.</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=axvrFeQOvEg\" data-code=\"axvrFeQOvEg\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/axvrFeQOvEg/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you! I've now submitted a question (though a different one from what I asked here).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25193-ethawyn","name":"ethawyn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T09:31:13-07:00","id":1301655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ethawyn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1301650#post1301650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Maybe I'm mis-remembering, but I didn't think the God Machine particularly cared about followers. My understanding was that God Machine cults sprung up from people who discovered Infrastructure and decided to worship it, but not from any particular design of the Machine (ala Cthulhu and those who worship him).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> For the most part, it doesn't. That doesn't mean it can't select a human as important for some weird, alien reason.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T09:33:45-07:00","id":1301657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ethawyn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1301640#post1301640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm still a little puzzled as to why the God-Machine even cares about transitioning Denmark from Norse Paganism to Catholicism. Does anyone have any ideas?</div> </div> </div> </div>Catholicism is much closer to direct worship of God-Machine than Norse Paganism ( that is much closer to Spirits worship )?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T09:45:09-07:00","id":1301661,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1301655#post1301655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> For the most part, it doesn't. That doesn't mean it can't select a human as important for some weird, alien reason.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair enough. Perhaps this could be indicated in the text, even if just a sentence or a clause thereof? A lot of people seem to be assuming that it's obvious the God Machine would prefer Abrahamic religion because the God Machine is singular, but that subtracts from the alien nature of the Machine. I prefer it to be more like Cthulhu than robot Satan, though of course that's up to individual writers and storytellers. <br /> <br /> Thanks for the response.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25193-ethawyn","name":"ethawyn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T09:53:43-07:00","id":1301662,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1301613#post1301613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/contagion-chronicle-a-chronicles-of-darkness-cross/posts/2465992&amp;quo