I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-03T23:06:11-07:00","id":1302477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1302397#post1302397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fair. NEW TOPIC.<br /> <br /> Actually, old one, favorite Vectors? I'll admit, I'm kind of sucker for Fire For Effect. It just kind of begs for one of those &amp;quot;Stride in and win&amp;quot; scenes even if it's not neccesarily as powerful as plenty of it's peers.</div> </div> </div> </div>Was thinking of posing the same question xD but yeah fire for effect is my favourite, the flavour text is the best of the lot personally. I imagine the interaction between splats once they get used to each other will be an excellent source of role play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25080-kargle18446","name":"Kargle18446","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-03T23:15:20-07:00","id":1302478,"title":"","content":"On the subject of Edges and Specialization, I feel like the wording on Specializations could use some massaging. Reading through the Edges description I was getting the right interpretation, but from the Specialization paragraph I was getting the other one. And reading through the rest of the stuff I was still getting the proper idea, but that was leaving me confused. So there was confusion on at least a few peoples reads.<br /> <br /> Going through the Vectors I definitely found myself thinking of past characters and what they would do with them/where they would end up and Realignment is so my jam and my Ordo Mekhet in particular got excited at the Renewal Specialization.<br /> <br /> Lastly, it's been a busy day and I'm only just getting to sit down with San Fran, but holy shit Geist and Demon are basically my two favorite lines. I'm only down to reading about the Dead War and I love it so much. I have to sit down and FORCE people to learn CofD in my area just so I can run a Cisco game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3776-autodefenestrate","name":"AutoDefenestrate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T00:31:34-07:00","id":1302493,"title":"","content":"I figure we might see other Specializations if we get certain things to line up in the stretch goals; for example, the Deceived, masters of nomenclature (name magic) gain no special benefit when using either of the high end Semiotics, including &quot;Name&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T00:42:09-07:00","id":1302495,"title":"","content":"And we are past 55k $, so we unlocked...<br /> <br /> <b>CONTAGION CHRONICLE: PLAYER'S COMPANION - <i>&quot;Death&quot;</i></b> - A Player\u2019s Companion PDF supplement will be created for the Contagion Chronicle, containing a crunchy rules section on supernatural interactions with examples and guidance (ie, &quot;What happens when a Vampire does &quot;X&quot; to a Mage?&quot;). Will be added to the rewards list of all backers receiving the Contagion Chronicle PDF.<br /> <br /> Yey!!! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T01:48:38-07:00","id":1302502,"title":"","content":"2 things!<br /> <br /> 1. I hope in Death that we get not only the needed crunch rules for how supers interact with like &quot;Oh what spells affects angels and vampires and how does a abillity impact other supernaturals and so on&quot; but i would also like guides for how supernaturals can specifically combine their powers to work together. Not just like &quot;oh the werewolf can be the fighter and the demon spies on people&quot; but like ideas for how a Mage a Vampiric Blood Sorcerer and Sin Eater Ceremonies Master could work together on doing one big ritual together or how Changelings and Beasts could double team to affect dreams through their different approaches and how Demonic Embeds and Exploits could be combined with Promethean Transmuations.<br /> <br /> 2. I got an idea for the Heroes edge of the Evolve Realignment Vector: Heroes being accustomed to always evolving their legend can reclaim the power they once held, if a Hero kills a beast within a week of being given ability through evolve and without it having been done again in the meantime..will be able to reclaim their previously borrowed power permanently as their newest Gift.<br /> <br /> So yeah...we are talking nasty business here if we ever get to see their edges as sworn members.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8100-caedus","name":"Caedus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"300"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T04:24:12-07:00","id":1302516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quo