hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T14:08:46-07:00","id":1303176,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>branford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303160#post1303160\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now, was the Hierarch in the story telling the truth about dealing with the Contagion, or was she infected or False?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd suspect False, or at least working with them. The team seems a Sworn faction and getting rid of them seems more like a high priority for False than for infected.<br /> <br /> It could just be usual mage possessive squabbling, not wanting another mage potentially leaking Big Secrets to the rest of the mage world until the Hierarch and their favorites get what they want from it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 04-06-2019, 05:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T16:15:05-07:00","id":1303211,"title":"","content":"We're now sub-$1K to the next stretch goal. That should mean we hit it before the end of the weekend. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T18:02:20-07:00","id":1303224,"title":"","content":"Speaking of Homestuck I\u2019m thinking of Writing a Homestuck/Contagion Chronicles crossover <br /> <br /> What Splats would the various Homestuck Characters by. I think Sollux Captor would by a Moro\u2019s Mage given his SGRUB title Mage of Doom.<br /> <br /> Hearing the voices of the Dead and his general personality.<br /> <br /> Aradia as a Sin-Eater her being the Caretaker of the \u201cDreaming Dead\u201d and shit .<br /> <br /> I actually think of Rose with a Makara Soul.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T21:52:15-07:00","id":1303247,"title":"","content":"Reading and studying Vectors now, I wonder on some assignment to Ship of Theseus. Recalling to you all...<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1301947#post1301947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ship of Theseus \u2013 Realignment Vector \u2013 Typical members are: Prometheans, demons and Sin-Eaters. Joins to them Free Council, Carthian Movement, Ordo Dracul, Iron Masters, Spring Court and Network Zero.</div> </div> </div> </div>Realignment Vector powers are all about 'tearing things down to make place for new'. This idea works for Free Council, Carthian Movement, Iron Masters - and in more physical meaning - for Ordo Dracul. Maybe Network Zero, as they 'tear down lies of society to show truth'.<br /> <br /> However Spring Court is odd here. Citing <b>CtL</b> 2E corebook: 'The Spring Court exults in life and harnesses desire to make life worth living.'<br /> <br /> I'm surprised that it's not Autumn Court here - as Autumn is Changeling version of Ordo Dracul, does it not? Dissecting, logical change, deliberate destroying psychic of enemy...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-07-2019, 02:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T23:13:32-07:00","id":1303255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303247#post1303247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm surprised that it's not Autumn Court here - as Autumn is Changeling version of Ordo Dracul, does it not? Dissecting, logical change, deliberate destroying psychic of enemy...</div> </div> </div> </div>The Spring Court's literal actual modus operandi for keeping away the Fae is &quot;be as far as possible from the thing you were in your Durance, particularly as far as hesitation and personal weaknesses are concerned.&quot; Their whole focus as a coping mechanism is about putting the past behind them.<br /> <br /> Insofar as &quot;the Lost equivalent of the Ordo Dracul&quot; is a thing at all, the Autumn Court is not it just because they pay attention to the minutiae of magic and draw power from a season associated with entropy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T05:17:33-07:00","id":1303297,"title":"","content":"I think the Autumn court is closer to the Circle of the Crone, they like magic a lot.<br /> <br /> But honestly I see Autumn being attracted to all of them, if for no other reason then Autumn would want some members of their court to have access to each of the vectors.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T05:55:45-07:00","id":1303303,"title":"","content":"Now up, the Contagion of Sustenance in the Republique Democratique du Congo.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T06:18:27-07:00","id":1303307,"title":"","content":"Given it\u2019s about the Congo .Fuck WWF there a bunch of Imperialist Greenwasher's That steal land Indigenous land <a href=\"https://www.survivalinternational.org/emails/wwf\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.survivalinternational.org/emails/wwf</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T06:32:43-07:00","id":1303309,"title":"","content":"Okay, the Bloody Ones are seriously one of the best and most innovative form of zombie I've ever seen.<br /> <br /> Because once the Contagious Ebola hits the bloodstream, it...doesn't, kill you. In any way. As in, the Bloody Ones still have their minds intact, that's part of what makes them so dangerous; they're often smarter than the infection itself, and the infection itself has a hive mind that can give them needed info to help the infection survive and spread. Besides hitting a very different form of horror than raw survivalism, that also means they <i>can </i>be cured; a person who decides that the solution to these zombies is cranial lead exposure is outright wrong and is entirely deserving of being shot. Which also ties into how one of the things that really kills foreign hunters is the fact Congolese Vigilants are really fucking sick of the White Man's Burden shit and aren't particularly interested in saving them. You need to seriously ask if this outbreak needs the burn-out-the-sickness approach or a vaccine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T06:35:19-07:00","id":1303310,"title":"","content":"I know ,Fuck neo-Imperialism and imperialism in general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T10:06:27-07:00","id":1303345,"title":"","content":"So, I'm open to other perspectives, but using the ongoing humanitarian and environmental crises in the Congo as a setting seems concerning to me. Using Ebola as the inspiration for a fictional supernatural disease seems tone deaf to me.<br /> <br /> There also seem to be some missteps in terms of cultural sensitivity here. The idea that post-modern Neo-pagan vampires would have natural affinity with indigenous tribal religion seems presumptuous at best, but is nowhere near as troubling as the idea that the Congo is a haven for Beasts and their Primordial dream who nobly defend the indigenous peoples from outside encroachment all the while being killed by ignorant primitive Heroes.<br /> <br /> I'm not saying that any of these ideas should be out of bounds. I'm not in any position to make demands. I'm simply saying that this chapter threw up some red flags for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25193,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25193-ethawyn","user":"ethawyn","date":".  Edited to fix the flow of the paragraphs. 04-07-2019, 01:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25193-ethawyn","name":"ethawyn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T10:13:15-07:00","id":1303348,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ethawyn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303345#post1303345\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I'm open to other perspectives, but using the ongoing humanitarian and environmental crises in the Congo as a setting seems concerning to me. There also seem to be some missteps in terms of cultural sensitivity here. Using Ebola as the inspiration for a fictional supernatural disease seems tone deaf to me. <br /> <br /> The idea that post-modern Neo-pagan vampires would have natural affinity with indigenous tribal religion seems presumptuous at best, but is nowhere near as troubling as the idea that the Congo is a haven for Beasts and their Primordial dream who nobly defend the indigenous peoples from outside encroachment all the while being killed by ignorant primitive Heroes. <br /> <br /> I'm not saying that any of these ideas should be out of bounds. I'm not in any position to make demands. I'm simply saying that this chapter threw up some red flags for me.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have the same feeling. some of this is a little high brow (almost like a political statement if any worse)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T10:32:49-07:00","id":1303353,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ethawyn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303345#post1303345\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There also seem to be some missteps in terms of cultural sensitivity here. The idea that post-modern Neo-pagan vampires would have natural affinity with indigenous tribal religion seems presumptuous at best</div> </div> </div> </div>It makes sense given that the Circle isn't just a bunch of modernites who whipped up their covenant yesterday. They're a sanctuary and collective for followers of pagan gods whose worshipers have been persecuted from the dawning of belief until now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T10:36:42-07:00","id":1303354,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ethawyn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303345#post1303345\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I'm open to other perspectives, but using the ongoing humanitarian and environmental crises in the Congo as a setting seems concerning to me. Using Ebola as the inspiration for a fictional supernatural disease seems tone deaf to me.<br /> <br /> There also seem to be some missteps in terms of cultural sensitivity here. The idea that post-modern Neo-pagan vampires would have natural affinity with indigenous tribal religion seems presumptuous at best, but is nowhere near as troubling as the idea that the Congo is a haven for Beasts and their Primordial dream who nobly defend the indigenous peoples from outside encroachment all the while being killed by ignorant primitive Heroes.<br /> <br /> I'm not saying that any of these ideas should be out of bounds. I'm not in any position to make demands. I'm simply saying that this chapter threw up some red flags for me.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know but it tries to talk about Social issues and Vulture capitalism.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T10:48:52-07:00","id":1303357,"title":"","content":"( Not read Contagion Congo setting itself, yet ) I'm not sure if <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar38_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"38\" data-vbnamecard=\"38\">Cinder</a> wrote Contagion setting - but he for two years now write <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1047206-fanmade-dark-era-beast-geist-the-forest-that-weeps\">19th century Congo fan Dark Era for Beast and Geist</a> - and if you read the superb fan stuff he made for it, you will agree that Beast is <i>perfect</i> for showing this kind social problems. With Geist 2E making bold metaphors - like 'ghosts are immigrants of Underworld' - I think there is a place for social commentary in CoD settings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T10:54:29-07:00","id":1303359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ethawyn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303345#post1303345\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I'm open to other perspectives, but using the ongoing humanitarian and environmental crises in the Congo as a setting seems concerning to me. Using Ebola as the inspiration for a fictional supernatural disease seems tone deaf to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>We <i>already</i> have canonical <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/the-jeremiad-contagion-chronicle/\" target=\"_blank\">Jeremiad Sworn origin as coming from Plague of Justinian</a>. Is it fair to have epidemic that killed 1/3 of Byzantine Empire in 6th till 8th century be okay as game faction creation point, but not okay Ebola in modern times as Contagion exemplary setting? If we can use historical events in fiction, we surely can use modern issues.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T10:56:20-07:00","id":1303360,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303357#post1303357\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">( Not read Contagion Congo setting itself, yet ) I'm not sure if <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> wrote Contagion setting - but he for two years now write <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1047206-fanmade-dark-era-beast-geist-the-forest-that-weeps&amp;quot;]19th</a> century Congo fan Dark Era for Beast and Geist[/URL] - and if you read the superb fan stuff he made for it, you will agree that Beast is <i>perfect</i> for showing this kind social problems. With Geist 2E making bold metaphors - like 'ghosts are immigrants of Underworld' - I think there is a place for social commentary in CoD settings.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait what! Can someone tell my the lore differences between 1 and 2 Edtion Geist?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T11:00:04-07:00","id":1303362,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303360#post1303360\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wait what! Can someone tell my the lore differences between 1 and 2 Edtion Geist?</div> </div> </div> </div>Read Geist 2E <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/down-in-the-dark-geist-the-sin-eaters/\" target=\"_blank\">Underworld preview blog post</a> - especially fragments about River Citizens. It points ghosts as forced immigrants in foreign lands that do not want them, but also force them to be there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T11:01:19-07:00","id":1303363,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ethawyn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303345#post1303345\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There also seem to be some missteps in terms of cultural sensitivity here. The idea that post-modern Neo-pagan vampires would have natural affinity with indigenous tribal religion seems presumptuous at best, but is nowhere near as troubling as the idea that the Congo is a haven for Beasts and their Primordial dream who nobly defend the indigenous peoples from outside encroachment all the while being killed by ignorant primitive Heroes.</div> </div> </div> </div>1. CoC doesn't have to be postmodern neopagan.<br /> 2. Beasts are killed by heroes of their culture and other cultures.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T11:42:07-07:00","id":1303375,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ethawyn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303345#post1303345\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I'm open to other perspectives, but using the ongoing humanitarian and environmental crises in the Congo as a setting seems concerning to me. Using Ebola as the inspiration for a fictional supernatural disease seems tone deaf to me.<br /> <br /> There also seem to be some missteps in terms of cultural sensitivity here. The idea that post-modern Neo-pagan vampires would have natural affinity with indigenous tribal religion seems presumptuous at best, but is nowhere near as troubling as the idea that the Congo is a haven for Beasts and their Primordial dream who nobly defend the indigenous peoples from outside encroachment all the while being killed by ignorant primitive Heroes.<br /> <br /> I'm not saying that any of these ideas should be out of bounds. I'm not in any position to make demands. I'm simply saying that this chapter threw up some red flags for me.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think these are some valid concerns for any fiction but from my reading of the chapter I dont feel like these topics have been approached insensitivity or embellished for effect. Each of the Contagions previewed so far have been based on a real issue in the region and I don't think using Ebola here is any different to those we've already seen. <br /> <br /> I don't think the Beast thing is anything to be concerned about, I think the ones your referring to are meant to be Beasts from the native population, not a load of white-man heroes come to save the defenceless tribes, although that's not too clear in the text.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25080-kargle18446","name":"Kargle18446","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T11:54:32-07:00","id":1303377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kargle18446</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303375#post1303375\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think these are some valid concerns for any fiction but from my reading of the chapter I dont feel like these topics have been approached insensitivity or embellished for effect. Each of the Contagions previewed so far have been based on a real issue in the region and I don't think using Ebola here is any different to those we've already seen. <br /> <br /> I don't think the Beast thing is anything to be concerned about, I think the ones your referring to are meant to be Beasts from the native population, not a load of white-man heroes come to save the defenceless tribes, although that's not too clear in the text.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait what? Can someone tell my more of how all the contagions are based of issues in Their City\u2019s? I\u2019m actually quite interested?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T12:14:04-07:00","id":1303380,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303377#post1303377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wait what? Can someone tell my more of how all the contagions are based of issues in Their City\u2019s? I\u2019m actually quite interested?</div> </div> </div> </div>Extreme depression for the Hollow/Intolerance one etc.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T12:16:39-07:00","id":1303381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303377#post1303377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wait what? Can someone tell my more of how all the contagions are based of issues in Their City\u2019s? I\u2019m actually quite interested?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well it mean it's just my reading so I might be totally wrong, but for example San Francisco Contagion is similar to economic issues created by spiralling living costs and the increasing levels of competition just to live in the city, whereas New Zealands' is a commentary on the problems caused by invasive species and cultures into a balanced ecosystem. Most of them tend to reference this is the Moods and Themes sections.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25080-kargle18446","name":"Kargle18446","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T13:50:07-07:00","id":1303403,"title":"","content":"Cool. I love how sans Francisco is Ghost gentrifications. They should call the chapter ghost gentrifications.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T15:32:38-07:00","id":1303418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303403#post1303403\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cool. I love how sans Francisco is Ghost gentrifications. They should call the chapter ghost gentrifications.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> To further point something out the average cost of renting in san fracisco is pretty damn high as in unless you have a pretty good job your gonna have to live in rent control.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.rentcafe.com/average-rent-market-trends/us/ca/san-francisco/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rentcafe.com/average-ren...san-francisco/</a><br /> <br /> Also, for the vampire prince planning to leave I am pretty sure his herd wants to come along<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://sf.curbed.com/2019/3/27/18283377/survey-poll-leaving-bay-area-housing-crisis-gentrification\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://sf.curbed.com/2019/3/27/18283377/survey-poll-leaving-bay-area-housing-crisis-gentrification\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://sf.curbed.com/2019/3/27/18283377/survey-poll-leaving-bay-area-housing-crisis-gentrification\" target=\"_blank\"> https://sf.curbed.com/2019/3/27/18283377/survey-poll-leaving-bay-area-housing-crisis-gentrification </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T15:51:18-07:00","id":1303422,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reaperfrost8</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303418#post1303418\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> To further point something out the average cost of renting in san fracisco is pretty damn high as in unless you have a pretty good job your gonna have to live in rent control.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.rentcafe.com/average-rent-market-trends/us/ca/san-francisco/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rentcafe.com/average-ren...san-francisco/</a><br /> <br /> Also, for the vampire prince planning to leave I am pretty sure his herd wants to come along<br /> <a href=\"https://sf.curbed.com/2019/3/27/18283377/survey-poll-leaving-bay-area-housing-crisis-gentrification\" target=\"_blank\">https://sf.curbed.com/2019/3/27/1828...gentrification</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah. Social issues do not really make the horror of a situation worse. The Congolese Contagion is the horror of being stuck in a country ravaged by colonizers, and quite by accident there's been a new disease that threatens to impact the entire world. The mutant Ebola is, in a sense, a Jordan Peele-esque metaphor for the horror of being colonized; the virus doesn't hate its hosts, it doesn't care about them, but it exploits them and uses them to better its own self before discarding them and leaving broken lives and bodies behind, all in the name of its own prosperity. And its hosts know it, but are forced to play its game.<br /> <br /> Besides, a lot of people are going to want to use the Congo as a Weekend in Hell adventure. It'd be bloody irresponsible to point out that doing so runs the risk of the same adventurism that broke it in the first place, and then makes reactions to that adventurism a plot point when it turns out the natives aren't especially happy about white guys barging in and claiming to be able to solve their problems, again. It's actually very classically Gothic; the sins of the metaphorical father, Emperor Leopold, threaten to devour the son(s and daughters).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T17:44:22-07:00","id":1303439,"title":"","content":"So far the New Zealand is the best of the bunch, but the others are cool as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T19:08:18-07:00","id":1303451,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303439#post1303439\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So far the New Zealand is the best of the bunch, but the others are cool as well.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I don't disagree. New Zealand shows just how mundane the danger from an alternate Earth would be; the viruses evolved different enough to cheat immunity and both worlds are idea landing grounds for bioinvasion. There's nothing supernatural about it, it's just an awful spice on a larger problem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T23:27:57-07:00","id":1303482,"title":"","content":"I am VERY amused at San Francisco being the Geist setting...mostly because I'm currently planning a chronicle for Geist's sister WoD gameline, Wraith. Reading through the setting, apparently the devs came to the same conclusion that I did on San Francisco being an oddly very appropriate place to set a game revolving around ghosts, lol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T06:20:02-07:00","id":1303511,"title":"","content":"So, the DRC in Contagion has plenty of focus on Beast. Perfect...all according to plan.<br /> <br /> (There's no plan. I did not write for this book, did not know about a DRC section and it's all just a lucky coincidence that plays well with my fanmade Dark Era and the moment I decide to put it on the Storyteller's Vault. But the section is good, I liked it a lot)<br /> <br /> EDIT: Though there's a couple minor things I think it's worth to point out: to say that during King's Leopold rule people were &quot;forced to work in mines where their toils brought massive profits to a king thousands of miles away while hundreds of thousands if not millions died&quot; implies the most of Congo's resources <i>and </i>most of the deaths happened because of those mines. Sorry, but that's just not even a correct approximation: while the mining operations in Congo were pretty much the one steady-ish source of money for King Leopold from the beginning to the end, those were not remotely as profitable as the sentence says nor where the worst aspects of Congo colonization happened. That would be the rubber harvest industry, though things were pretty much hell everywhere. Also, it was millions of people for sure, the real doubt being <i>how many</i>.<br /> <br /> Sorry, I know this sounds nitpicky, but those are a couple of sentences that really stand out if you know enough about the Congo Free State. It does not make the rest of the section any less good, of course.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 04-08-2019, 10:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T06:44:18-07:00","id":1303516,"title":"","content":"may i ask, are beasts fulfilling a different role in New Zealand? it sounds like they are fulfilling a rather morally white rather than grey role (of course, I will admit my inability to understand is probably just because I play my beasts as anti-villains and villain protagonist)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T07:24:26-07:00","id":1303526,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303516#post1303516\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">may i ask, are beasts fulfilling a different role in New Zealand? it sounds like they are fulfilling a rather morally white rather than grey role (of course, I will admit my inability to understand is probably just because I play my beasts as anti-villains and villain protagonist)</div> </div> </div> </div>...Er, do you mean the Congo rather than New Zealand? Beasts don't get any particular focus in NZ.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T07:58:54-07:00","id":1303529,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/contagion-chronicle-a-chronicles-of-darkness-cross/posts/2473980\" target=\"_blank\">A preview</a> of tommorow's history of the Contagion, spotlighting an Olmec breakout.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T08:41:57-07:00","id":1303533,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303526#post1303526\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ...Er, do you mean the Congo rather than New Zealand? Beasts don't get any particular focus in NZ.</div> </div> </div> </div>my bad, yes the Congo","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T10:22:56-07:00","id":1303555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303516#post1303516\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">may i ask, are beasts fulfilling a different role in New Zealand? it sounds like they are fulfilling a rather morally white rather than grey role (of course, I will admit my inability to understand is probably just because I play my beasts as anti-villains and villain protagonist)</div> </div> </div> </div>Assuming you mean the Congo, a huge part of Beast is about inflicting instructive nightmares; that's essentially the function of the Primordial Dream, according to Building a Legend. Information that normally you can't get more than once (ie. &quot;big man eating monster lives in yonder wasteland&quot;) can be disseminated that way to the masses on a subconscious level. In a more general sense, predators that engage in intimidation displays are trying to stop a fight from happening.<br /> <br /> In a more general sense, beasts tend to be protective of their territories and they can't benefit much from other beings spreading fear. Mortal trauma, inflicted by mortals, without a beast present, is of little use to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T11:21:44-07:00","id":1303572,"title":"","content":"I know that's the what the corebook presents, but in a place as isolated as the Congo, wouldnt be like the past where beast were less hungry and generally didnt NEED to teach lessons proactively?<br /> <br /> either that, or the beast are being nominally heroic, as you said, they have territory to defend","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T11:40:03-07:00","id":1303576,"title":"","content":"Came back after a long break, saw a kickstarter, backed it. Time to go through all of those previews :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T11:44:43-07:00","id":1303577,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303572#post1303572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know that's the what the corebook presents, but in a place as isolated as the Congo, wouldnt be like the past where beast were less hungry and generally didnt NEED to teach lessons proactively?<br /> <br /> either that, or the beast are being nominally heroic, as you said, they have territory to defend</div> </div> </div> </div>Well it think it's implied that a number of the Beasts come from the local population so it would make sense for them to be more possesive. The main Beast who caused the contagion for example is described as basically subjugating her tribe following her devouring.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25080-kargle18446","name":"Kargle18446","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T12:06:29-07:00","id":1303583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i><b>The First Language</b></i> <span style=\"color:#282828\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">The first language is the code that governs the God-Machine's programming, the Celestial Ladder, and the essence of Creation. It transcends time and space, and those who first mastered it tore it into a thousand pieces so none could follow them on this path to ascendant power. Azothic Memory retains fragments of it though, allowing Prometheans to master the dominant language of their surrounding as the first language is the root of <i>all </i>languages. This also grants all Prometheans +2 on checks to identify the San Lorenzo strain, and gives the Tammuz a further +1 bonus to resist infection.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#282828\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br /> <br /> Is this also supposed to be related to Mage's High Speech, the basis of language, or Werewolf's First Tongue, the first language?</span></span></span><br /> </span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T12:29:46-07:00","id":1303587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>branford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303583#post1303583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Is this also supposed to be related to Mage's High Speech, the basis of language, or Werewolf's First Tongue, the first language?[/SIZE][/FONT][/COLOR]<br /> [/FONT][/COLOR]</div> </div> </div> </div>Seems to me like its a seperate thing entirely only accessible to Prometheans due to what they are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24020-mateus","name":"Mateus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24020_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T12:42:55-07:00","id":1303590,"title":"","content":"The Celestial Ladder reference <i>screams</i> Mage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T13:18:44-07:00","id":1303597,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>branford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303583#post1303583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Is this also supposed to be related to Mage's High Speech, the basis of language, or Werewolf's First Tongue, the first language?[/SIZE][/FONT][/COLOR]<br /> [/FONT][/COLOR]</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Seems like it's even older. From the sound of it, First Tongue and High Speech are derivatives; the only people to master it tore it up, leaving only the God-Machine's core code and the Azothic Memory of it pure. Given how even passing familiarity with it makes angels, Unchained and loyal, omniglots, and even just seeing it turns humans into psychic stigmatics, reconstructing a lexicon would be an act of apotheosis in and of itself.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, I just realized; the Mexica nearly cured it, because they <i>figured it out.</i> Whatever info they found there build the civilization we found in Dark Ages, and perhaps the industrial skintheiving rituals from what they were able to decode. That shows the Rosetta Society isn't chasing a false hope; even partial decoding made the Aztecs from suffering the Broken Language to enjoying every minute of it. And if they truly cracked it some day...who knows? We might have schools teaching us about Cortez' Folly and the great Thaumaindustrial Revolution ushered in by the great inventor Zyacatl. Maybe in a place opened by the Contagion, there is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":". 04-08-2019, 04:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T13:41:19-07:00","id":1303599,"title":"","content":"Isn't language <i>before </i>High Speech impossible?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T13:43:46-07:00","id":1303601,"title":"","content":"It's a symbol of language, not really language any more than the concept of food is edible. So just like you wouldn't count the symbol of planes as 'the first plane' or the symbol of cars as 'the first car,' you wouldn't count High Speech as the 'first language.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 04-08-2019, 04:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T14:10:04-07:00","id":1303613,"title":"","content":"What about First Tongue?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T14:13:57-07:00","id":1303615,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>branford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303613#post1303613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about First Tongue?</div> </div> </div> </div>The first shared language of werewolves and spirits, not the programming language of the God Machine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T14:55:00-07:00","id":1303622,"title":"","content":"Anything new or interesting from the Youtube Livestream Contagion Q&amp;A?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T15:09:30-07:00","id":1303628,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303576#post1303576\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Came back after a long break, saw a kickstarter, backed it. Time to go through all of those previews :P</div> </div> </div> </div>Hope you enjoy, there\u2019s certainly a lot of neat and fun things so far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T15:35:22-07:00","id":1303633,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iceblade44</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303628#post1303628\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hope you enjoy, there\u2019s certainly a lot of neat and fun things so far.</div> </div> </div> </div>From the brief look I gave it it looks good. Starting from the example fiction, I must say that I immediately felt sorry for the characters- going all the way from Eilat to Acre only to be stopped and sent back? Now, that's just mean. Even my sister's reaction was &quot;come on!&quot;.<br /> <br /> Seriously, one has to be really desperate to try and do it, so that heirarch is a real bastard :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T16:13:50-07:00","id":1303642,"title":"","content":"Was there some 6th setting premiere in nearby of Mexico I do not know about?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T16:54:05-07:00","id":1303654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303642#post1303642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Was there some 6th setting premiere in nearby of Mexico I do not know about?</div> </div> </div> </div>The next update, tomorrow, is 'A history of Contagion and how the different factions formed.' And in the preview of it, we see an example of Contagion from ~900 BCE from the Gulf of Mexico region.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T16:55:06-07:00","id":1303655,"title":"","content":"No it seems to be a preview of the history section in the book I think","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-na