":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T20:33:03-07:00","id":1303702,"title":"","content":"Second Stretch Goal Funded! Global Outbreaks is a real thing coming out!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T01:52:37-07:00","id":1303737,"title":"","content":"Wait... fragments of a lost language? Message from the God Machine? The mesoamerican civilizations having fragments of it and trying to solve it?<br /> <br /> God-Machine damn it! The &quot;Black Sun Map&quot; is a Contagion, Marco Singe and the whole Deva Corporation spread it and we are all infected!<br /> <br /> EDIT: God Machine Double damn it, the Curses of the Furies are Strains of the Contagion by themselves!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T08:26:18-07:00","id":1303783,"title":"","content":"Someone goofed in the last update. In the summary of all existing previews to date, there\u2019s a \u201cSetting Preview #5: DRC\u201d link that links to the Sworn, False, and Vectors preview.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T09:06:22-07:00","id":1303787,"title":"","content":"the Justinian plague and Fall of Carthage I guessed since they were mentioned in Sworn histories. The Taiping Rebellion and Chernobyl was a surprise though, I would have thought the Zero Hour's to be WW1, another major but horrifically devoting war though does make it interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T09:55:15-07:00","id":1303794,"title":"","content":"Well that was as subtle way of doing some Dark Era settings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T13:53:15-07:00","id":1303822,"title":"","content":"Okay, yeah. THIS is the good stuff. I hereby withdraw all objections; Chapter Three was as eerie and evocative as I could have hoped for. Of the sample settings, San Francisco has grabbed me the most, and I\u2019m eager to see the others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/40-dspaul","name":"DSPaul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T17:39:51-07:00","id":1303851,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DSPaul</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303822#post1303822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, yeah. THIS is the good stuff. I hereby withdraw all objections; Chapter Three was as eerie and evocative as I could have hoped for. Of the sample settings, San Francisco has grabbed me the most, and I\u2019m eager to see the others.</div> </div> </div> </div>Quite. Me, I'm slightly disappointed, because I thought we were getting rules for Contagious first before history, and that it wasn't so intimately linked to the God-Machine (now I have to explain why Demon isn't the &quot;new Mage&quot; to fanboys..).<br /> <br /> Still, I like how nobody's really sure <i>how </i>it showed up, why, or what it is beyond &quot;a pattern of suborned Infrastructure that works like a plague,&quot; and the overview of the different types of Contagious. I like the spider-lady who thinks her parents are invaders of her actual parents' home, it shows there's still a person there, but very, very alien.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T18:34:32-07:00","id":1303860,"title":"","content":"If you hop over to youtube the third video of @The Gentleman Gamer's contagion game is up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24020-mateus","name":"Mateus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24020_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T19:59:00-07:00","id":1303868,"title":"","content":"Listening to the Q&amp;A, I like the idea of mixing in red Herrings, like maybe in New Zealand the characters are dealing with contagion, when a new mystery pops up, that feels unnatural, but it turns out it's the Abyss instead, or a Reaper. I might listen to it again and make a few notes. I'm glad my question on can a Bounds Geist use their vectors got answered.<br /> <br /> One thing I wish I had asked is will there be goals beyond the Contagion for each of the Sworn and False groups, reasons to work together and still gain vector XP. <br /> <br /> Like I can't see a group of Thesus and Jermaids having achieved the 5th dot wanting to give that up just because the Contagion is gone. I mean an Autumn Court Changeling, Ordo Dracul Vampire, Any Mage, with the ability to trade magics between each other and visit realms beyond their reach isn't going to want to give that up because the Contagion is gone. <br /> <br /> And someone who has tasted the Godhead power won't want to lose access to it. <br /> <br /> I just think longer term, broader goals for the factions would be nice beyond temporary outbreaks of contagion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 04-09-2019, 11:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T20:17:44-07:00","id":1303870,"title":"","content":"I had an idea for a contagion, where religious objects and rites really do damage Vampires, like crosses burn them like fire. <br /> <br /> So the religious blood sorceries of The ban Sorcery and Cruac actually burns any Vampire contact with it, like being in Sunlight. They magic still works if one endures it, but it hurts. Even Jerimiads Vectors have this effect. Any religion based magic and symbols abd even mundane rights. <br /> <br /> So the religious vampires can't wear a cross, enter their holy grounds or cast their magic safely. And its really benifiting Hunters.<br /> <br /> Other nearby cities have banned Vampires from the infected city from leaving it, a spiritual qurantine, creating rifts in the covenants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T20:21:49-07:00","id":1303871,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303868#post1303868\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just think longer term, broader goals for the factions would be nice beyond temporary outbreaks of contagion.</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean like the section of every single Faction writeup that details what they do when not pursuing the Contagion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T20:27:20-07:00","id":1303874,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303868#post1303868\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just think longer term, broader goals for the factions would be nice beyond temporary outbreaks of contagion.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's fan made but in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1137216-dark-eras-fan-byzantine-empire?p=1300455#post1300455\">my Byzantine Empire Dark Era the Sworn factions starts to fight Plauge of Justinian</a> - but then not letting out subject. As Plauge is returning for circa 200 years, after few decades of remission, Sworn understand they need to be on <b>constant</b> look out for it - and, de facto, <i>rule</i> Easter Roman Empire.<br /> <br /> Future Cryptocrats are creating predecessor of Invictus - <b><i>Athanatoi</i></b> - vampire conspiracy that looks over well-being of Empire. Quickly join others, similar thinking monsters to them. Athanatoi are often inner-fighting over power on Empire when not resolving issues with Contagion - but when Plauge is showing up, they universally put Empire above their individual ambitions. ( Think about vampire secret parliament, but with most monsters factions inside it. ) Until they resolve Contagion.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, <b><i>Jeremiad</i></b> Sworn are intermingling with structures of Eastern Orthodox Church - with Great Schism of 1054 ( and in reality, even from 3 century earlier) you get monster running state religion to fight 'cosmic' sickness.<br /> <br /> We also have predecessor of Rosetta Society - Byzantium is one of greatest learning centers on Earth of that time. <b><i>Omphalos</i></b> is secret society of researchers and occultist trying to 'scientifically' ( well, mystically ) understand Contagion that is troubling Empire. Name comes from <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omphalos\" target=\"_blank\">mythological stone letting to communicate directly with gods</a> \u2013 and Astral Space barrier that many mages and beasts find in their journeys inside souls. ( It's also first reason why mage Orders of Keepers of the Word and Pancryptiates joined in 12th century into Mysterium. )<br /> <br /> I also adding barbarian hordes for creating point of Naglfar\u2019s Army. They just wait for Viking to come to Byzantium to finally add Norse elements of their dogma and be complete. \ud83d\ude0e","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-09-2019, 11:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-10T02:05:01-07:00","id":1303902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1303868#post1303868\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One thing I wish I had asked is will there be goals beyond the Contagion for each of the Sworn and False groups, reasons to work together and still gain vector XP.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know what Sworn beats come from, but they sounded like they can show up regardless of whether the Contagion is in town. You can probably have very fun storylines involving the Sworn without the Contagion being involved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-10T06:56:09-07:00","id":1303931,"title":"","content":"And Kyoto is out to the backers!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"