u2019t the lodge keep an Idigam under lock and key?</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe it's meant to be a Maeljin that has partially entered the world. But it could just be a Maeljin or idigam from this other world.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T08:39:03-07:00","id":1307485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1307482#post1307482\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah we still need to ghost nuke San Fran, thank you for reminding me.</div> </div> </div> </div>A Sin-Eater with The Tomb at 3 dots ought to be able to make the Little Boy nuclear bomb from a photo, and it will be equally tangible to humans and ghosts, which is technically achievable right out of character creation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12738,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12738-minty","user":"Minty","date":". 04-24-2019, 11:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12738-minty","name":"Minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","v